{%- comment -%}
  Sustituye al formulario de compra mientras la venta no esté autorizada.
  Texto veraz (claims O-01/O-02 en docs/04_CLAIMS_APPROVAL.csv).

  Accepts:
  - product: {Object} producto (opcional)
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="ds-gate" role="status">
  <p class="ds-gate__title">
    <span class="svg-wrapper" aria-hidden="true">{%- render 'ds-icon', name: 'doc' -%}</span>
    {{ 'ds.gate.title' | t }}
  </p>
  <p class="ds-gate__text">{{ 'ds.gate.text' | t }}</p>
  <div class="ds-gate__actions">
    <a class="button button--secondary" href="/pages/use-and-safety">{{ 'ds.gate.safety' | t }}</a>
    <a class="link ds-link-arrow" href="/pages/faq">{{ 'ds.gate.faq' | t }}</a>
  </div>
</div>
